  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why This Happens",
      "char_file": "에너지드링크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "High blood pressure usually",
        "gives you nothing to feel",
        "",
        "But 3 ordinary things you",
        "drink and eat can move a",
        "reading within the hour"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Energy Drinks",
      "char_file": "에너지드링크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First is caffeine",
        "",
        "Across 15 studies, one energy",
        "drink raised systolic pressure",
        "4.4 mm Hg on average"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cap the Caffeine",
      "char_file": "에너지드링크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Check the can, not the cup",
        "",
        "400 mg a day is the ceiling",
        "for healthy adults —",
        "swap the 200 mg drink first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Black Licorice",
      "char_file": "사탕_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second is glycyrrhizin",
        "in real black licorice",
        "",
        "It makes the kidneys hold",
        "sodium and shed potassium"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Read the Label",
      "char_file": "사탕_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Most US licorice candy is",
        "anise oil, not licorice",
        "",
        "If licorice root is listed",
        "and you take BP medicine, ask"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hidden Sodium",
      "char_file": "소금_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Third is sodium you",
        "never added yourself",
        "",
        "Over 70% comes from packaged,",
        "prepared and restaurant food"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cut 1,000 mg",
      "char_file": "소금_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Compare labels on the two",
        "packaged foods you eat most",
        "",
        "The AHA says 1,000 mg less",
        "a day already helps"
      ]
    }
